$del_session — delete session output after the run finishes

SUMMARY
  Marks the current run for cleanup when the .ah script finishes. The session
  folder for this run is removed afterward. If this run created the sessions/
  folder and it is empty after removing the session, sessions/ is removed too.

SYNTAX
  $del_session

INPUT / OUTPUT
  Passes the input bundle through unchanged.

EXAMPLE
  @work: @topic -> $llm
  run @work -> $del_session

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
